# Obsidian Wiki Repository Rules

Resolve the nearest ancestor `.obsidian-wiki/config.toml` and read `AGENTS.md`.
Use task skills under `.skills/`; `.skills/llm-wiki/SKILL.md` owns source
authority and the transaction protocol. Stop on absent or invalid configuration,
and never create a direct-write workflow.
